"Guess the number!\n"
"The secret number is: 58\n"
"Please input your guess.\n"
"  76\n"
"You guessed: 76\n"
"Too big!\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```console\n"
"$ cargo run\n"
"   Compiling guessing_game v0.1.0 (file:///projects/guessing_game)\n"
"    Finished `dev` profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 0.26s\n"
"     Running `target/debug/guessing_game`\n"
"Guess the number!\n"
"The secret number is: 58\n"
"Please input your guess.\n"
"  76\n"
"You guessed: 76\n"
"Too big!\n"
"```"

#: src/ch02-00-guessing-game-tutorial.md:993
msgid ""
"Nice! Even though spaces were added before the guess, the program still "
"figured out that the user guessed 76. Run the program a few times to verify "
"the different behavior with different kinds of input: Guess the number "
"correctly, guess a number that is too high, and guess a number that is too "
"low."
msgstr ""
"很好！尽管在猜测之前添加了空格，程序仍然能够识别出用户猜的是76。请多次运行该"
"程序，以验证不同输入情况下的行为：正确猜测数字、猜测过高的数字，以及猜测过低"
"的数字。"

#: src/ch02-00-guessing-game-tutorial.md:998
msgid ""
"We have most of the game working now, but the user can make only one guess. "
"Let’s change that by adding a loop!"
msgstr ""
"目前大部分游戏功能已经可以正常运行了，但是用户只能进行一次猜测。让我们通过添"
"加一个循环来解决这个问题吧！"

#: src/ch02-00-guessing-game-tutorial.md:1001
msgid "Allowing Multiple Guesses with Looping"
msgstr "通过循环实现允许多次猜测"

#: src/ch02-00-guessing-game-tutorial.md:1003
msgid ""
"The `loop` keyword creates an infinite loop. We’ll add a loop to give users "
"more chances at guessing the number:"
msgstr ""
"``loop``这个关键字会导致无限循环。我们将添加一个循环，让用户有更多的机会来猜"
"测数字："

#: src/ch02-00-guessing-game-tutorial.md:1048
msgid ""
"As you can see, we’ve moved everything from the guess input prompt onward "
"into a loop. Be sure to indent the lines inside the loop another four spaces "
"each and run the program again. The program will now ask for another guess "
"forever, which actually introduces a new problem. It doesn’t seem like the "
"user can quit!"
msgstr ""
"如您所见，我们已经将所有内容从猜测输入提示处开始，转移到了一个循环中。请注"
"意，循环内的每一行都要再缩进四个空格，然后再次运行程序。现在，程序会不断要求"
"用户输入新的猜测值，这实际上引入了一个新的问题。看起来用户无法退出该程序！"

#: src/ch02-00-guessing-game-tutorial.md:1053
msgid ""
"The user could always interrupt the program by using the keyboard shortcut "
"<kbd>ctrl</kbd>\\-<kbd>C</kbd>. But there’s another way to escape this "
"insatiable monster, as mentioned in the `parse` discussion in [“Comparing "
"the Guess to the Secret Number”](#comparing-the-guess-to-the-secret-"
"number)<!-- ignore -->: If the user enters a non-number answer, the program "
"will crash. We can take advantage of that to allow the user to quit, as "
"shown here:"
msgstr ""
"用户总是可以通过使用键盘快捷键 <kbd>ctrl</kbd>\\-<kbd>C</kbd>来中断程序。 但"
"是还有另一种方法来逃避这个难以忍受的怪物，正如在`parse`的讨论中所提到的][将猜"
"测与秘密号码比较”](#comparing-the-guess-to-the-secret-number)<! - 忽略 -->: "
"如果用户输入非数字答案, 程序将崩溃。 我们可以利用这个机会让用户退出，如下所"
"示："

#: src/ch02-00-guessing-game-tutorial.md:1070
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"$ cargo run\n"
"   Compiling guessing_game v0.1.0 (file:///projects/guessing_game)\n"
"    Finished `dev` profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 0.23s\n"
"     Running `target/debug/guessing_game`\n"
"Guess the number!\n"
"The secret number is: 59\n"
"Please input your guess.\n"
"45\n"
"You guessed: 45\n"
"Too small!\n"
"Please input your guess.\n"
"60\n"
"You guessed: 60\n"
"Too big!\n"
"Please input your guess.\n"
"59\n"
"You guessed: 59\n"
"You win!\n"
"Please input your guess.\n"
"quit\n"
"\n"
"thread 'main' panicked at src/main.rs:28:47:\n"
"Please type a number!: ParseIntError { kind: InvalidDigit }\n"
"note: run with `RUST_BACKTRACE=1` environment variable to display a "
"backtrace\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```console\n"
"$ cargo run\n"
"   Compiling guessing_game v0.1.0 (file:///projects/guessing_game)\n"
"    Finished `dev` profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 0.23s\n"
"     Running `target/debug/guessing_game`\n"
"Guess the number!\n"
"The secret number is: 59\n"
"Please input your guess.\n"
"45\n"
"You guessed: 45\n"
"Too small!\n"
"Please input your guess.\n"
"60\n"
"You guessed: 60\n"
"Too big!\n"
"Please input your guess.\n"
"59\n"
"You guessed: 59\n"
"You win!\n"
"Please input your guess.\n"
"quit\n"
"\n"
"thread 'main' panicked at src/main.rs:28:47:\n"
"Please type a number!: ParseIntError { kind: InvalidDigit }\n"
"note: run with `RUST_BACKTRACE=1` environment variable to display a "
"backtrace\n"
"```"

#: src/ch02-00-guessing-game-tutorial.md:1097
msgid ""
"Typing `quit` will quit the game, but as you’ll notice, so will entering any "
"other non-number input. This is suboptimal, to say the least; we want the "
"game to also stop when the correct number is guessed."
msgstr ""
"输入 `quit` 将会退出游戏，但正如您会注意到的，输入任何其他非数字内容同样会导"
"致游戏退出。这至少可以说是不理想的；我们希望在猜中正确的数字时，游戏也能停"
"止。"

#: src/ch02-00-guessing-game-tutorial.md:1101
msgid "Quitting After a Correct Guess"
msgstr "正确猜测后退出"

#: src/ch02-00-guessing-game-tutorial.md:1103
msgid ""
"Let’s program the game to quit when the user wins by adding a `break` "
"statement:"
msgstr "让游戏程序在用户赢得胜利时通过添加 \"断线\" 语句来退出："

#: src/ch02-00-guessing-game-tutorial.md:1147
msgid ""
"Adding the `break` line after `You win!` makes the program exit the loop "
"when the user guesses the secret number correctly. Exiting the loop also "
"means exiting the program, because the loop is the last part of `main`."
msgstr ""
"让我们在代码中加入一个 ``break`` 语句，这样当用户获胜时，游戏就会自动退出。"

#: src/ch02-00-guessing-game-tutorial.md:1151
msgid "Handling Invalid Input"
msgstr "处理无效输入"

#: src/ch02-00-guessing-game-tutorial.md:1153
msgid ""
"To further refine the game’s behavior, rather than crashing the program when "
"the user inputs a non-number, let’s make the game ignore a non-number so "
"that the user can continue guessing. We can do that by altering the line "
"where `guess` is converted from a `String` to a `u32`, as shown in Listing "
"2-5."
msgstr ""
"进一步完善游戏行为，而不是在用户输入非数字时崩溃程序， 让游戏忽略一个非数字，"
"这样用户可以继续猜测。 我们可以通过将`猜ess`从`String`转换为`u32`的行变换成"
"`u32`的方式来做到这一点，这在列表2-5中已经显示。"

#: src/ch02-00-guessing-game-tutorial.md:1207
msgid ""
"We switch from an `expect` call to a `match` expression to move from "
"crashing on an error to handling the error. Remember that `parse` returns a "
"`Result` type and `Result` is an enum that has the variants `Ok` and `Err`. "
"We’re using a `match` expression here, as we did with the `Ordering` result "
"of the `cmp` method."
msgstr ""
"我们从 \"预期\" 调用到 \"匹配\" 表达式，来从崩溃到处理错误。 请记住，`parse` "
"返回一个 `Result` 类型和 `Result` 是一个有变量`Ok` 和 `Err`的枚举。 我们在这"
"里使用 `match` 表达式，就像我们使用 `cmp` 方法的 `Ordering` 结果一样。"

#: src/ch02-00-guessing-game-tutorial.md:1213
msgid ""
"If `parse` is able to successfully turn the string into a number, it will "
"return an `Ok` value that contains the resultant number. That `Ok` value "
"will match the first arm’s pattern, and the `match` expression will just "
"return the `num` value that `parse` produced and put inside the `Ok` value. "
"That number will end up right where we want it in the new `guess` variable "
"we’re creating."
msgstr ""
"如果`parse`能够成功地将字符串转换为数字，它将返回包含结果数字的`Ok`值。 那个"
"`Ok`值将匹配第一个装甲的图案， 和 `match` 表达式只会返回`parse`生成并放入`Ok`"
"值中的`num`值。 这个数字最终将会在我们正在创建的新的 `guess` 变量中找到它的位"
"置。"

#: src/ch02-00-guessing-game-tutorial.md:1219
msgid ""
"If `parse` is _not_ able to turn the string into a number, it will return an "
"`Err` value that contains more information about the error. The `Err` value "
"does not match the `Ok(num)` pattern in the first `match` arm, but it does "
"match the `Err(_)` pattern in the second arm. The underscore, `_`, is a "
"catch-all value; in this example, we’re saying we want to match all `Err` "
"values, no matter what information they have inside them. So, the program "
"will execute the second arm’s code, `continue`, which tells the program to "
"go to the next iteration of the `loop` and ask for another guess. So, "
"effectively, the program ignores all errors that `parse` might encounter!"
msgstr ""
"如果`parse` 是_not_ 能够将字符串转换为数字，它将返回包含更多有关错误信息的 "
"`Err` 值。 `Err`值与第一个`匹配`参数中的`Ok(num)`模式不匹配，但它与第二个参数"
"中的`Err(_)`模式匹配。 下划线`_`是一个包罗万象的值； 在这个例子中，我们说我们"
"想匹配所有`错误'值，不管它们内有什么信息。 因此，程序将执行第二个arm的代码，"
"`continue`， 这会告诉程序转到下一次循环的迭代，然后再来问问问答。 因此，该程"
"序实际上忽略了所有“解析”可能产生的错误！"

#: src/ch02-00-guessing-game-tutorial.md:1229
msgid "Now everything in the program should work as expected. Let’s try it:"
msgstr "现在程序中的所有内容都应该按照预期正常工作了。让我们试试看："

